Audio
-----
vendor/webrtc_neteq contains a WebRTC NetEq subset from branch-heads/5481,
with Abseil 20230125.3 and Opus public headers from opusic-sys 0.7.5.
Source: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/refs/branch-heads/5481/
Preserved notices: LICENSE, PATENTS, AUTHORS, absl/LICENSE and
third_party/opus/src/COPYING within vendor/webrtc_neteq.
src/audio/neteq_bridge.cc is the application adapter. The build disables
WebRTC logging/tracing and post-decode VAD; original source notices remain.
vendor/speexdsp retains its license in COPYING. Opus is built through the
opusic-c/opusic-sys dependency, with its upstream license.

